-- REFINEMENT ----------- errors/ghost_in_runtime_1.march

`limit` is ghost, so the running program cannot use it. [ghost_in_runtime]

3 |     if x > limit do limit else x end
               ^^^^^

    Ghost values exist only for proofs and are erased before the program runs. Use them in refinements, lemma arguments, ghost arguments, `ghost let` and proof hints.
    run `march --explain ghost_in_runtime`


